3. THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

   The Software displays and depends on material that is not the property
   of the copyright holders and is not covered by this notice. That
   material remains subject to its own respective licenses and terms.

   a. Artist data

      All artist, member, location, date and relation data, and all artist
      images, are fetched at runtime from the public Groupie Trackers API
      (https://groupietrackers.herokuapp.com/api). None of it is stored in
      this repository. It remains the property of its owners.

   b. Geographic data

      `data/coordinates.json` holds coordinates obtained from the Nominatim
      geocoding service. Those coordinates are derived from OpenStreetMap
      data, Copyright OpenStreetMap contributors, and are made available
      under the Open Database License (ODbL), Version 1.0
      (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/).

      The artist page also loads map tiles at runtime from the OpenStreetMap
      tile servers. Those tiles are Copyright OpenStreetMap contributors and
      are subject to the OpenStreetMap Foundation's tile usage policy.

   c. Leaflet

      The artist page loads the Leaflet map library, version 1.9.4, from the
      unpkg content delivery network at runtime. Leaflet is not distributed
      with the Software. It is Copyright Vladimir Agafonkin and Copyright
      CloudMade, and is licensed under the BSD 2-Clause License
      (https://github.com/Leaflet/Leaflet/blob/main/LICENSE).

   d. Fonts

      Every page loads the Figtree typeface from Google Fonts at runtime.
      The font files are not distributed with the Software. Figtree is
      Copyright The Figtree Project Authors
      (https://github.com/erikdkennedy/figtree) and is licensed under the
      SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

